  "new_exact_bindings": [
    "OriginalLiteralS1CountDictionary.samePsiS1_cast_eq_native_pure_pairs starts with the independently defined original samePsiS1/principalRow, factors the actual (nm,ell*r)=1 mean, and sums the one shared m into paperCommonMCount ell*r*s.",
    "OriginalLiteralS1AtlasIdentification.original_samePsiS1_eq_owned_atlas connects original D S1 to independently defined D atlasPureS1 via actual q3-piece coverage, active d zeros, and zero rough endpoints.",
    "OriginalPrimitiveS1Atlas.original_primitiveS1_eq_main_add_remainder consumes independently frozen E peer primitiveS1 with its actual (q,a)=1 carrier, preserving that filter in Main and Remainder. No substitution of D unfiltered S1 is made.",
    "The filtered error is controlled by the positive full divisor kernel. Genuine singleton-q FixedBlocks reuse the previously proved uniform count estimate; no false norm(filtered)<=norm(unfiltered) comparison is used."
  ],
  "actual_error_bounds": [
    "OriginalPrimitiveS1Atlas.original_primitiveS1_sub_main_le_log_over_Y: actual primitive original S1-MT <=C*U^2*(1+log x)^38/Y, Y=Q1*D.",
    "OriginalS1KeyMultiplicityPayment.actual_keyBank_card_le_log derives actual finite-image bank cardinality <=keyLogConstant^6*(1+log x)^6 from log2 physicalCap and actual cap<=4*x^2.",
    "actual_weighted_S1Error_le_log44 sums every actual key with its genuine Y_k factor and bounds by C*U^2*(1+log x)^44.",
    "actual_outerKeyS1Error_le_log50 includes a further actual bank cardinality factor for outer finite Cauchy, before the M power margin is spent.",
    "actual_M_lower_half derives actual M>=x^(1/2) from the original restricted-medium monomial by reusing U<=x^(1/2).",
    "actual_weighted_S1Error_log_payment and actual_outerKeyS1Error_log_payment choose x0 before every atom, original receiver/trim and key and pay arbitrary log precision by the actual M length.",
    "Original numeric z is passed only through the exact strictReceiverCutoff support translation; original analytic z is unchanged."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "No full restricted-medium theorem, S2/S3 zero-mode cancellation or E1/E2/spectral return is claimed.",
    "The beta L2 and other original fixed-order logarithmic factors in the complete preliminary Cauchy are separate source costs; these all-A S1 counting payments are available to absorb the corresponding later fixed log costs.",
    "Principal Gram positivity and original term (15) analytic variance bound are not assumed or reproved here; they remain the independent medium_variance lane for the identified same-q/same-alpha/same-lambda source.",
    "All new/held imports and complete selected transitive proof closure still need user-owned compiler/kernel qualification."
  ],
